      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "newAtten is my Internship submission to DJUBO Hospitality. Carefully \nworked on for over five weeks, this is the submission of Satyam Prakash\n\nFor Front-End, it uses AngularJS, alongside JQuery and bootstrap, while for \nbackend it relies on Django as framework and MySQL for database. \n\nIt has five endpoints\n    \n    => /employee \n          \n           For handling login, from where you can login either as admin, or as an\n           employee\n\n    => /employee/dashboard \n            \n            This is the main dashboard from where an employee can access \n             there dashboard \n  \n    => /employee/admin\n\n             The admin panel, where an admin can have quick view to there employee \n             and there stats, as well as accept or decline any leave\n\n    => /employee/applyLeave \n\n             An endpoint from where you can an employee can apply for leave",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "newAtten is my Internship submission to DJUBO Hospitality. Carefully \nworked on for over five weeks, this is the submission of Satyam Prakash\n\nFor Front-End, it uses AngularJS, alongside JQuery and bootstrap, while for \nbackend it relies on Django as framework and MySQL for database. \n\nIt has five endpoints\n    \n    => /employee \n          \n           For handling login, from where you can login either as admin, or as an\n           employee\n\n    => /employee/dashboard \n            \n            This is the main dashboard from where an employee can access \n             there dashboard \n  \n    => /employee/admin\n\n             The admin panel, where an admin can have quick view to there employee \n             and there stats, as well as accept or decline any leave\n\n    => /employee/applyLeave \n\n             An endpoint from where you can an employee can apply for leave",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
